sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor L as Lecturer
  participant UI as Web UI
  participant Course as Course API
  participant DB as Database

  L->>UI: Open generated mini-course
  L->>UI: Click Share
  activate UI

  UI->>Course: POST /mini-courses/{courseId}/share
  activate Course
  Course->>DB: Generate/update shareToken
  activate DB
  DB-->>Course: shareToken saved
  deactivate DB

  alt [token generated]
    Course-->>UI: Shareable link
    UI-->>L: Display link (copy)
  else [generation failed]
    Course-->>UI: 500 Error
    UI-->>L: Display error + allow retry
  end

  deactivate Course

  deactivate UI
